    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Foglit is an action roguelike, with RPG-inspired elements. You explore the cursed and ever-changing, ruined lands of Cirilis ... all that assuming that you can fight or run your way through. Checkpoints are only at the start of chapters and before chapter boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, die, learn, repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427540/extras/0af3532d0718f4cb75f0fb7c2f73c140.poster.avif?t=1746362439\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427540/extras/0af3532d0718f4cb75f0fb7c2f73c140.webm?t=1746362439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427540/extras/0af3532d0718f4cb75f0fb7c2f73c140.mp4?t=1746362439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Foglit you assume the role of a journeyman mage embarking on a journey to complete the work of their fallen mentor to cleanse the land by fulfilling an ancient pact with the guardian of this land. As a measure of protection, you use chronomancy to scout ahead by creating a new body that projects your power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427540/extras/637239ed6ffbcccef5b274fe0a6de049.poster.avif?t=1746362439\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427540/extras/637239ed6ffbcccef5b274fe0a6de049.webm?t=1746362439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427540/extras/637239ed6ffbcccef5b274fe0a6de049.mp4?t=1746362439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While your body may be safe, you still feel anything your projection does, and whenever the projection is destroyed, you will need to cast the ritual again to make a new projection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427540/extras/54ac982449a77adacfa0c6ddbc51382f.poster.avif?t=1746362439\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427540/extras/54ac982449a77adacfa0c6ddbc51382f.webm?t=1746362439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427540/extras/54ac982449a77adacfa0c6ddbc51382f.mp4?t=1746362439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience magic runes a comprehensive system of upgrades and unlockable recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During each run, you get to choose 1 rune at every level up and you also choose if you want to store that rune or use it in that run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each run, you get access to every rune you save. You can combine the stored runes and obtain more powerful runes that will be unlocked during any run thereafter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full rune system contains over <strong>450 recipes</strong> split across 3 tiers <strong>Fundamental</strong>, <strong>Elemental</strong>, and <strong>Cosmic</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427540/extras/f89b2ed029a88c66664f1f6f8b086076.poster.avif?t=1746362439\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427540/extras/f89b2ed029a88c66664f1f6f8b086076.webm?t=1746362439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427540/extras/f89b2ed029a88c66664f1f6f8b086076.mp4?t=1746362439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will have consequences, impacting the story and leading to multiple endings. Will you confront every boss in your path, or find a way to circumvent them? Renew the covenant. Break the cycle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Foglit is an action roguelike, with RPG-inspired elements. You explore the cursed and ever-changing, ruined lands of Cirilis ... all that assuming that you can fight or run your way through. Checkpoints are only at the start of chapters and before chapter boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, die, learn, repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427540/extras/0af3532d0718f4cb75f0fb7c2f73c140.poster.avif?t=1746362439\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427540/extras/0af3532d0718f4cb75f0fb7c2f73c140.webm?t=1746362439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427540/extras/0af3532d0718f4cb75f0fb7c2f73c140.mp4?t=1746362439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Foglit you assume the role of a journeyman mage embarking on a journey to complete the work of their fallen mentor to cleanse the land by fulfilling an ancient pact with the guardian of this land. As a measure of protection, you use chronomancy to scout ahead by creating a new body that projects your power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427540/extras/637239ed6ffbcccef5b274fe0a6de049.poster.avif?t=1746362439\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427540/extras/637239ed6ffbcccef5b274fe0a6de049.webm?t=1746362439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427540/extras/637239ed6ffbcccef5b274fe0a6de049.mp4?t=1746362439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While your body may be safe, you still feel anything your projection does, and whenever the projection is destroyed, you will need to cast the ritual again to make a new projection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427540/extras/54ac982449a77adacfa0c6ddbc51382f.poster.avif?t=1746362439\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427540/extras/54ac982449a77adacfa0c6ddbc51382f.webm?t=1746362439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427540/extras/54ac982449a77adacfa0c6ddbc51382f.mp4?t=1746362439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience magic runes a comprehensive system of upgrades and unlockable recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During each run, you get to choose 1 rune at every level up and you also choose if you want to store that rune or use it in that run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each run, you get access to every rune you save. You can combine the stored runes and obtain more powerful runes that will be unlocked during any run thereafter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full rune system contains over <strong>450 recipes</strong> split across 3 tiers <strong>Fundamental</strong>, <strong>Elemental</strong>, and <strong>Cosmic</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427540/extras/f89b2ed029a88c66664f1f6f8b086076.poster.avif?t=1746362439\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427540/extras/f89b2ed029a88c66664f1f6f8b086076.webm?t=1746362439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427540/extras/f89b2ed029a88c66664f1f6f8b086076.mp4?t=1746362439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will have consequences, impacting the story and leading to multiple endings. Will you confront every boss in your path, or find a way to circumvent them? Renew the covenant. Break the cycle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Brave the cursed lands of Cirilis, in Foglit, a top-down action roguelite. Hack and slash through monsters, and collect powerful runes to customize your build. Unravel a dark story with impactful choices and multiple endings. Can you break the cycle?",
